# SimpleOS production status ledger — canonical owner + maturity per subsystem.
# Master plan: doc/01_research/domain/simpleos_production_host_master_plan.md §22 Phase 0.
# Guarded by test/01_unit/os/arch/duplicate_owner_spec.spl (ledger/code parity).
# maturity: production | partial | model | evidence-only | host-proxy | stub | duplicate
# Progress notes reflect landed+pushed convergence tranches (2026-07-27):
#   Stage S/P/INT, T2 (container/DeviceGrant/flock), T3-T4 (Podman-MDSOC+ mgr+OCI),
#   FV/FV2 (Lean proofs), SVC (service_v1), UPD (TUF), SQ (SQLite-VFS contract).

production_status:
  abi_contract:
    owner: os.kernel.abi.abi_v1
    lane: A00
    maturity: partial
    note: ABI v1 frozen by reference (Stage S); duplicate-owner guard green
  kernel_types:
    owner: os.kernel.types
    lane: A00
    maturity: production
  ipc:
    owner: os.kernel.ipc
    lane: A01
    maturity: partial
    note: single-use capability guard landed + Lean-proven (SingleUse); l4_fast_ipc marked honest model; full fastpath pending
  capability_spawn:
    owner: os.kernel.ipc.cspace_spawn
    lane: A02
    maturity: model
    note: root-only ambient-spawn guard wired (3/3 sites); boot seal GATED OFF pending SpawnSpec migration + QEMU boot evidence; live child CSpace injection still pending
  loader:
    owner: os.kernel.loader
    lane: A02
    maturity: partial
    note: spawn_authority guard + effective-rights helpers landed; descriptor-based exec pending
  memory:
    owner: os.kernel.memory
    lane: A02
    maturity: partial
  vfs:
    owner: os.kernel.fs
    lane: A03
    maturity: partial
    note: VfsHandleTable handle->mount routing landed (8 mounts[0] bypasses removed in services/vfs + LLM dispatch); src/lib fs_driver + 4 FAT32 copies still coexist — full collapse multi-increment
  drivers:
    owner: os.drivers
    lane: A04
    maturity: partial
    note: DeviceGrant runtime ABI + 10-step crash-revocation ordering landed + Lean-proven (no-DMA-without-IOMMU); wiring into real driver bind/crash path pending
  posix:
    owner: os.posix
    lane: A05
    maturity: partial
    note: no writable shared mmap, no pthreads; profile matrix must stop over-claiming
  tty:
    owner: os.kernel tty paths
    lane: A06
    maturity: partial
    note: tty_write now delivers bytes to a drainable output buffer; PTY master/slave round-trip pending
  ssh:
    owner: os simple-native sshd
    lane: A06
    maturity: model
    note: x86_64-only FS-exec arms; OpenSSH port is the production path (multi-week, blocked)
  containers:
    owner: os container contract
    lane: A07
    maturity: partial
    note: kernel ContainerNamespaceView rootless deny-by-default enforcement + Lean-proven isolation; Podman-on-MDSOC+ manager (sys_create/pod_wire/start/stop) + OCI edge adapter landed; live lookup-site wiring + boot evidence pending
  web_server:
    owner: os.http
    lane: A09
    maturity: partial
    note: native raw benchmark fast; routed server interpreter-bound
  database:
    owner: simple db embedded (SDN store)
    lane: A09
    maturity: partial
    note: SQLite sqlite3_vfs contract landed (rollback-journal supported, WAL honestly gated on absent shared mmap); actual SQLite amalgamation build is multi-session (C toolchain blocked); server tier absent
  config:
    owner: std.config (to extract from IDE config)
    lane: A10
    maturity: partial
    note: std.config core extracted to src/lib/common/config_core (schema+layers, mandatory-as-ceiling); IDE call-site swap pending
  browser:
    owner: browser tree
    lane: A10
    maturity: model
    note: production-blocking isolation/origin/lifecycle gaps (renderer/network/GPU split multi-session)
  llm_profiles:
    owner: os security llm profile registry
    lane: A07
    maturity: partial
    note: profile registry (deny-wins intersection, 6 built-ins) + spawn effective-rights adapter landed + Lean-proven attenuation; live spawn-syscall wiring pending
  service_manifest:
    owner: os.services.service_manifest
    lane: A06
    maturity: partial
    note: typed service_v1 lifecycle/health/watchdog/restart-limit + §21 restart-drops-stale-grants invariant; real services declaring manifests pending
  update_tuf:
    owner: os.services.update.tuf_metadata
    lane: A07
    maturity: model
    note: TUF 4-role verifier (rollback/freeze/threshold/snapshot/untrusted-key defenses); real crypto sig verify + A/B transactional install + SLSA provenance blocked on crypto stack
  formal_verification:
    owner: src.verification (kernel_capabilities + os_enforcement)
    lane: A11
    maturity: partial
    note: sorry-free Lean proofs — single-use, container isolation, device-grant no-DMA-without-IOMMU, profile attenuation; VFS-transaction/WAL-ordering invariants pending
  evidence:
    owner: spipe sdn receipts
    lane: A11
    maturity: partial
    note: fail-closed on missing/stale artifacts not yet universal
